---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me" description="About Sofia — Sofiverse, Product and Graphic Designer">

  <section class="about">
    <div class="container">

      <a href="/" class="back-link">← go back to home</a>

      <h1 class="about__title">About Me</h1>

      <div class="about__grid">

        <div class="about__image">
          <img src="/img-sofiverse.webp" alt="Sofia — Sofiverse" />
        </div>

        <div class="about__text">
          <p>My name is Sofia (a.k.a. Sofiverse) and I'm a Senior Brand Designer with a background in Architecture.</p>

          <p>After leading multidisciplinary teams in housing projects and collaborating with international organizations like the UN and GIZ, I discovered web3 in 2022 (and fell in love). I transitioned into tech, where I combine my passion for design and systems thinking to create intuitive digital experiences.</p>

          <p>Over the past four years, I've designed coordination platforms and dApps for open-source, funding, and regenerative projects that strengthen the onchain economy, impact, and reputation systems. I thrive in collaborative environments and am driven by the opportunity to build meaningful tools that improve how Web3 communities operate.</p>

          <p>I build brand systems for technical teams.</p>

          <p>Which usually means this: you've built something good, you know what it does, but the brand around it (the site, the deck, the social, the way the product looks and feels) doesn't quite match. Sometimes it's outdated. Sometimes it's inconsistent. Sometimes it just hasn't been done yet because you've been busy shipping.</p>

          <p>That's where I come in. I take the raw material (what you're building, who it's for, why it matters) and turn it into one visual and strategic language you can apply everywhere.</p>

          <p>Product, marketing, and everything in between.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-24);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-8);
  }

  /* ── Back link ── */
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-link);
    color: var(--color-text-ghost);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  /* ── Page title ── */
  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  /* ── Two-column grid ── */
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 43fr 57fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ── Image ── */
  .about__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── Text ── */
  .about__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about__text p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }

    .about__title {
      font-size: var(--text-h4);
    }
  }
</style>
